\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Belief $\sigma _{xy}$ (top) and EE-to-block distance (bottom) over a representative successful episode. Gray shaded spans mark wrist-camera occlusion windows. Uncertainty grows during each occlusion as particles spread via the predict step alone. Once occlusion clears and the agent approaches, $\sigma _{xy}$ collapses rapidly as the distance-dependent noise model produces tight likelihoods at close range. The dashed green line marks the auto-grasp trigger.}}{5}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:belief-evo}{{3}{5}{Belief $\sigma _{xy}$ (top) and EE-to-block distance (bottom) over a representative successful episode. Gray shaded spans mark wrist-camera occlusion windows. Uncertainty grows during each occlusion as particles spread via the predict step alone. Once occlusion clears and the agent approaches, $\sigma _{xy}$ collapses rapidly as the distance-dependent noise model produces tight likelihoods at close range. The dashed green line marks the auto-grasp trigger}{figure.3}{}}
\newlabel{fig:belief-evo@cref}{{[figure][3][]3}{[1][5][]5}}
